From 30912596db946bdce7da5b74b32a60a8ea38053c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR Recomp <noreply@lr-recomp.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:22:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 007/108] core(android): add Android system glue and jthread
 flag

- include/rex/main_android.h declares rex::GetAndroidApiLevel() (included by
  memory_posix.cpp / threading_posix.cpp, previously missing).
- src/core/android_system.cpp defines GetAndroidApiLevel (cached
  android_get_device_api_level), InitializeAndroidSystemForApplicationContext /
  ShutdownAndroidSystem (call the memory/thread/filesystem Android init and
  shutdown hooks), filesystem::AndroidInitialize/Shutdown (no-op),
  IsAndroidContentUri and a stub OpenAndroidContentFileDescriptor (-1).
- timer_queue.cpp gets -fexperimental-library on Android as on Apple
  (std::jthread/stop_token gated in the NDK libc++).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

